          "en": "New AI agent models like GLM-5.2 are emerging, representing a capability threshold, while Google DeepMind implements a comprehensive security roadmap for internal AI systems.",
          "zh": "GLM-5.2等新型人工智能代理模型正在涌现，代表着能力阈值的提升，与此同时，Google DeepMind正在为其内部人工智能系统实施一项全面的安全路线图。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
