            "Google DeepMind is implementing an \"AI Control Roadmap\" that combines \"traditional safeguards and real-time monitoring\" for securing internal systems with AI agents.",
            "\"Local Coding Agents\" utilize \"Open-Weight Models in Local Coding Harnesses\" as an alternative to existing subscriptions."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "GLM-5.2被认为是“开放代理的转折性进展”和一个“能力阈值”。",
