        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "These developments indicate continued progress in the practical application and sophistication of AI agents, necessitating robust security frameworks for their deployment, especially in industrial and critical infrastructure contexts.",
          "zh": "这些进展表明人工智能代理在实际应用和复杂性方面的持续进步，因此需要在部署时建立强大的安全框架，尤其是在工业和关键基础设施领域。"
        },
